{"id":"8a4d6bb923655efc","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-special-model.md","title":"Special Model","display":"df-special-model — Special Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-special-model","aliases":["17-df-special-model"],"display":"df-special-model — Special Model","depends_on":["[[17-df-elementary-chain]]","[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","[[17-df-chain-union]]"],"source_section":"5.1","source_result":"Special-model definition and Proposition 5.1.6(ii)","source_pages_print":[295],"source_pages_djvu":[311],"source_verification":"definition and finite-model case compared in supplied OCR; chain uses all smaller cardinals","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-5.2.1"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-special-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-special-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-special-model — Special Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9a564fd35615a768\" href=\"?note=9a564fd35615a768\" title=\"17-df-elementary-chain\">17-df-elementary-chain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cbea1b33aeed1412\" href=\"?note=cbea1b33aeed1412\" title=\"17-df-chain-union\">17-df-chain-union</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"5.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Special-model definition and Proposition 5.1.6(ii)"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>295</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>311</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"definition and finite-model case compared in supplied OCR; chain uses all smaller cardinals"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-5.2.1"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is a cardinal, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|\">\\(|\\cdot|\\)</span> on sets denotes cardinality.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> is an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure, with carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>; hence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\">\\(\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\\)</span> denotes its cardinality.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L\\)</span> are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9a564fd35615a768\" href=\"?note=9a564fd35615a768\" title=\"17-df-elementary-chain\">17-df-elementary-chain</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cbea1b33aeed1412\" href=\"?note=cbea1b33aeed1412\" title=\"17-df-chain-union\">17-df-chain-union</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda\">\\(\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\beta)\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\beta)\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\kappa\">\\(D_\\kappa\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Special}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Special}_\\kappa\\)</span> are defined here; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\kappa\">\\(D_\\kappa\\)</span> is the strict ordinal order.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nD_\\kappa&amp;=\\{\\beta&lt;\\kappa:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\beta)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Special}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak A)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|=\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists(\\mathfrak A_\\beta)_{\\beta\\in D_\\kappa}\\;\n\\Bigl[\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L(D_\\kappa,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_\\beta)_{\\beta\\in D_\\kappa})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L(D_\\kappa,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_\\beta)_{\\beta\\in D_\\kappa},\\mathfrak A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\beta\\in D_\\kappa\\;\\forall\\lambda\\;\n(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\beta)\n\\to\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda(\\mathfrak A_\\beta))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nD_\\kappa&amp;=\\{\\beta&lt;\\kappa:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\beta)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Special}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak A)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|=\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists(\\mathfrak A_\\beta)_{\\beta\\in D_\\kappa}\\;\n\\Bigl[\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L(D_\\kappa,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_\\beta)_{\\beta\\in D_\\kappa})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L(D_\\kappa,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_\\beta)_{\\beta\\in D_\\kappa},\\mathfrak A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\beta\\in D_\\kappa\\;\\forall\\lambda\\;\n(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\beta)\n\\to\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda(\\mathfrak A_\\beta))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is the definition of a special model in §5.1, printed p.295, DjVu page 311. The chain is indexed by all cardinals below the model cardinality, including finite cardinals, and every stage is saturated at the successor of its index. The stage cardinalities are not prescribed. Finite models are included, as in Proposition 5.1.6(ii). Omitting the finite index conditions would incorrectly make every countable model special.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-elementary-chain","status":"resolved","id":"9a564fd35615a768","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-chain-union","status":"resolved","id":"cbea1b33aeed1412","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-chain-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ is a cardinal, $\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ is from [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]], and $|\\cdot|$ on sets denotes cardinality.","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-chain","status":"resolved","id":"9a564fd35615a768","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L$ and $\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ are from [[17-df-elementary-chain]] and [[17-df-chain-union]].","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-chain-union","status":"resolved","id":"cbea1b33aeed1412","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L$ and $\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ are from [[17-df-elementary-chain]] and [[17-df-chain-union]].","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda$ is from [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]], and $\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\beta)$ is from [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]].","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda$ is from [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]], and $\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\beta)$ is from [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|\\cdot|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Special}_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nD_\\kappa&=\\{\\beta<\\kappa:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\beta)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Special}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak A)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|=\\kappa\\\\\n&\\land\\exists(\\mathfrak A_\\beta)_{\\beta\\in D_\\kappa}\\;\n\\Bigl[\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L(D_\\kappa,<,(\\mathfrak A_\\beta)_{\\beta\\in D_\\kappa})\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L(D_\\kappa,<,(\\mathfrak A_\\beta)_{\\beta\\in D_\\kappa},\\mathfrak A)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\beta\\in D_\\kappa\\;\\forall\\lambda\\;\n(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\beta)\n\\to\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda(\\mathfrak A_\\beta))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2447,"backlinks":[{"id":"be9d6cafebcc4c1b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Special}_\\kappa$ is from [[17-df-special-model]]."},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-special-model]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formu